  "solution": "Given equation: **{{(15 + 3) - (4 × 2)} ÷ (4 - 6)]} × 5 = 10**\n\n**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c01dc5af55cd705dbe2724575c5ece02dea759b56ed33a10ce3ec5ee3baaf343.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one. \n\n1. + and -\n\nGiven equation: {{(15 + 3) - (4 × 2)} ÷ (4 - 6)]} × 5 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ {(__**15 − **____**3**__) + (__**4 × **____**2**__)} ÷ (__**4 + **____**6**__) × 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**12**____** + 8**__} ÷ 10 × 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**20**____** ÷ 10**__ × 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**2 **____**× **____**5**__} = 10\n\n⇒ 10 = 10\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n2. + and x\n\nGiven equation: {{(15 + 3) - (4 × 2)} ÷ (4 - 6)]} × 5 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ {(__**15 × **____**3**__) − (__**4 + **____**2**__)} ÷ (__**4 − **____**6**__) + 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {45 − 6} ÷ (-2) + 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**45**____** − 6**__} ÷ (-2) + 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**39**____** ÷ (-2)**__ + 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {**__-19.5 __**__**+ **____**5**__} = 10\n\n⇒ -14.5 ≠ 10 \n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3. + and ÷\n\nGiven equation: {{(15 + 3) - (4 × 2)} ÷ (4 - 6)]} × 5 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ {(__**15 ÷ **____**3**__) − (__**4 × **____**2**__)} + (__**4 − **____**6**__) × 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {__**5**____** − 8**__} + (-2) × 5} = 10\n\n⇒ {(-3)} + __**(-2) × **____**5**__} = 10\n\n⇒ __**{(-3)} + (-10)**__} = 10\n\n⇒ -13 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4. x and ÷\n\nGiven equation: {{(15 + 3) - (4 × 2)} ÷ (4 - 6)]} × 5 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ {(__**15 + **____**3**__) − (__**4 ÷ **____**2**__)} × (4__** **____**− **____**6**__) ÷ 5 = 10\n\n⇒ {__**18**____** − 2**__} × (−2)} ÷ 5 = 10\n\n⇒ {__**16**____** × (−2**____**)**__} ÷ 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**-32**____** ÷ 5**__ = 10\n\n⇒ -6.4 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 1**\".",
